Package: RegCompassR
Title: Multiome Regulatory Evidence and Metabolic Reaction Analysis
Version: 2.2.10
Authors@R: c(person(given = "RegCompass", family = "Developers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dev@example.com"))
Author: RegCompass Developers [aut, cre]
Maintainer: RegCompass Developers <dev@example.com>
Description: Integrates paired single-cell RNA and ATAC regulatory evidence with genome-scale metabolic analysis. Stage 1 applies one fixed min_cells threshold before normalization, persists the exact retained analysis-cell IDs, and Stage 2 reuses that ordered cell set for metacell construction. Condition-aware Pando uses condition-full outer-heldout TF-by-ATAC projections, while standard Pando is used when fewer than two condition levels are available. Metacells use cell-type-scoped multimodal WNN graphs and condition-pure membership.
